Water dimer, PBE: Grimme D3(BJ) dispersion correction from modules/vdw_lib

&CPMD
 OPTIMIZE WAVEFUNCTION
 CONVERGENCE ORBITALS
  1.0d-6
 VDW CORRECTION
&END
&SYSTEM
 SYMMETRY
  1
 ANGSTROM
 CELL
  9.0 1.0 1.0 0.0 0.0 0.0
 CUTOFF
  40.0
&END
&DFT
 FUNCTIONAL PBE
&END
&VDW
 GRIMME CORRECTION
  VDW VERSION
   D3org-BJ
  VDW RCUT
   30.0
  VDW PERIODIC
   1 1 1
  VDW INTERACTIONS
   1 1 1
   2 1 1
 END GRIMME
&END
&ATOMS
*O_GO.psp
 LMAX=P
  2
  0.0000  0.0000  0.1173
  2.9000  0.0000  0.0000
*H_GO.psp
 LMAX=S
  4
  0.0000  0.7572 -0.4692
  0.0000 -0.7572 -0.4692
  3.4000  0.0000  0.7600
  3.4000  0.0000 -0.7600
&END
